        "body": "## Summary\n\nUpdates the org profile README to reflect current Divine branding, architecture, and active repositories.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Replaced outdated diVine naming with Divine\n- Updated repo map to current core services and apps\n- Added explicit deprecation note:\n  - divine-cdn-worker is deprecated and replaced by divine-blossom\n- Removed stale/obsolete architecture wording and tightened contribution guidance\n\n## Why\n\nThe current org README was out of date and could mislead contributors (and LLM-assisted workflows) about active repos and architecture direction.\n",
